      "returnType": "template<. . . Types> TTuple<Types& . . .>",
      "docs": "Tie function for structured unpacking of tuples into individual variables.\nExample:\nTTuple<FString, float, TArray<int32>> SomeFunction();\nFString Ret1;\nfloat Ret2;\nTArray<int32> Ret3;\nTie(Ret1, Ret2, Ret3) = SomeFunction();\n// Now Ret1, Ret2 and Ret3 contain the unpacked return values."
    }
